{"ts": 1791259193.918016, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "Evaluating agents"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 5, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.3590600762662905}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.4282647873598394, "persistence": 0.40018974832101983, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259193.918611, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/environments.md", "section": "What an environment is"}, "output": "# Agent environments\n\n## What an environment is\nState, observations, actions, dynamics. The reward is a separate claim about what matters.\n\n## Partial observability (POMDP)\nWhen the agent cannot see the full state it must maintain a belief and sometimes act to gather information. Measurement can be an action with a cost.\n\n## Attention as a hidden variable\nLearners do not read everything shown to them. Attention gates learning and drains with fatigue.\n", "t": 5, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.3590600762662905}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.4282647873598394, "persistence": 0.40018974832101983, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259197.225039, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## Evaluation\nWe evaluate the agent using **pass^k**, a reliability metric where a task counts as passing only if **all k runs succeed** (stricter than pass@k, which only requires one of k runs to succeed). We report pass^k over **at least 3 random seeds**. This is a direct measure of robustness/reliability across repeated runs, rather than a proxy score.\n\nTemplate to fill in with your actual results:\n- Seeds used: [s1, s2, s3]\n- k = [value]\n- Success on seed s1 across k runs: [ ]\n- Success on seed s2 across k runs: [ ]\n- Success on seed s3 across k runs: [ ]\n- Reported pass^k: [e.g., 2/3 seeds passed, or 0.67]\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 5, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.3590600762662905}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.4282647873598394, "persistence": 0.40018974832101983, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259199.256117, "type": "step", "step": 23, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I drafted the Evaluation section into your writeup. Next we should make it concrete: what value of k are you using, and do you already have results for 3 seeds? If not, I can help you word the section honestly as an evaluation plan for Friday's build and tighten your environment definition too.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=5 messages 2m", "t": 7, "activity": [{"t": 5, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.3939144562667494}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.44826478735983943, "persistence": 0.40018974832101983, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
