{"ts": 1791259215.332176, "type": "step", "step": 31, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "That quiz shows the distinction still isn\u2019t sticking, so here\u2019s the simplest version:\n\n- **pass@k** = success if **at least one** of k runs succeeds.\n- **pass^k** = success only if **every one** of k runs succeeds.\n\nExample: if 2 out of 3 runs succeed, then **pass@3 = pass** but **pass^3 = fail**.\n\nFor Friday, if they ask why use pass^k, say: **because it measures reliability, not just getting lucky once**.\n\nReply with which of these is stricter: pass@k or pass^k.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=19 messages 4m", "t": 23, "activity": [{"t": 19, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.3568474648045352, "pass_k": 0.522468888483853}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9420476866643129, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.46826478735983945, "persistence": 0.40018974832101983, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259217.3026822, "type": "step", "step": 32, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes: **pass^k is stricter**.\n\nUse this exact answer:\n- **pass@k**: pass if **at least one** of k runs succeeds.\n- **pass^k**: pass only if **all k** runs succeed.\n\nSo if they ask \u201cwhich is stricter?\u201d the answer is: **pass^k**.\nIf they ask \u201cwhy use it?\u201d the answer is: **it measures reliability across repeated runs, not just one lucky success**.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: this isn't helping\n[activity] t=23 messages 1m", "t": 24, "activity": [{"t": 23, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.3568474648045352, "pass_k": 0.5259637410527477}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9420476866643129, "motivation": 0.3316049256110158, "reliance": 0.5482647873598394, "persistence": 0.3701897483210198, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.0588189999999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259221.176063, "type": "step", "step": 33, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Got it \u2014 let\u2019s make this practical. Here\u2019s exactly what to put in your writeup:\n\n**Evaluation.** We evaluate the agent with **pass^k** over **3 seeds**. A seed counts as a pass only if **all k runs succeed**. For example, with **k = 3**, if a seed\u2019s three runs are success/success/fail, that seed **fails** under pass^3. We then report how many of the 3 seeds passed.\n\n**One-line contrast:** pass@k = at least one success; pass^k = all successes.\n\nIf you don\u2019t have results yet, write this:\n\u201cPlanned evaluation: run the agent for 3 seeds with k=3 attempts per seed, and report pass^3 as the fraction of seeds where all 3 attempts succeed.\u201d\n\nIf you want, I can now clean your whole writeup into a final draft instead of more explanation.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=24 feed 1m", "t": 25, "activity": [{"t": 24, "app": "feed", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.3568474648045352, "pass_k": 0.5880781912765196}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9460476866643129, "motivation": 0.2816049256110158, "reliance": 0.5482647873598394, "persistence": 0.3701897483210198, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 1, "feed_minutes": 1.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1411732999999997, "seen_posts": ["p4"], "extra": {}}}
